WEBVTT

00:24:27.121 --> 00:24:32.913
and then combine that carbon dioxide with
renewable hydrogen to make hydrocarbons,

00:24:32.913 --> 00:24:36.079
which is just a scientific way of
saying make fuels out of it?

00:24:36.579 --> 00:24:40.954
So you're trying to turn seawater
into fuel shorthand?

00:24:40.954 --> 00:24:44.788
Yes, that's what we would say, is
it's turning seawater into fuel.

00:24:45.204 --> 00:24:48.288
Cathy immediately saw this as a crucial
environmental breakthrough

00:24:48.288 --> 00:24:52.413
for Extra to fund. So she
went all in foghorn.

00:24:52.704 --> 00:24:55.288
That's what they named the project
was going to be her baby.

00:24:56.038 --> 00:24:59.121
But as someone whose job was to protect
other people from escalation,

00:24:59.454 --> 00:25:02.204
Cathy knew she needed to be
wary of it at the outset.